<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7234" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀν-απλόω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unfold, open,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταρσὸν ἀναπλώσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Mosch.
					2.60
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς θύρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Babr.
					74.3
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, of pods or flowers, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.159
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.113
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>cause to expand,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ -οῦν τὰ σώματα τὴν θερμότητα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anon.
					<u>in Cat.</u>
					49.26
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>explain, unravel,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Anon.
				<u>in Tht.</u>
				23.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Corp.Herm.</u>
				1.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>in Euc.</u>
				p.4F.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπορίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simp.
					<u>in Ph.</u>
					441.11
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>simplify,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέχρι τοῦ ἑνός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					5
				</span></i>
			:—so in 
				Pass.
			, of compounds, <i>to be resolved into simple elements,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.433
			</span></i> (s. v. l.): pf.
			part.
			
				Pass.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνηπλωμένος</span>
			<i>open, shallow,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λοπάδας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PHolm.</u>
					11.17
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ως,</span> q. v.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
